WEBVTT

00:21:29.276 --> 00:21:31.276
We've lived in this neighborhood forever.

00:21:31.276 --> 00:21:33.836
If we're not scared,
you shouldn't be scared."

00:21:33.836 --> 00:21:36.036
And I was saying this

00:21:36.076 --> 00:21:39.556
because not only are they
pushing him militarily back,

00:21:39.596 --> 00:21:43.196
but also if you look at the Ukrainian
Defense ministry

00:21:43.236 --> 00:21:45.396
or any of the online space,

00:21:45.436 --> 00:21:47.516
they're constantly trolling Putin.

00:21:47.516 --> 00:21:48.716
Constantly.

00:21:48.756 --> 00:21:53.196
And it’s done with incredible humor,
and it’s very, very effective.

00:21:53.196 --> 00:21:55.396
And so they know something
that we don't know.

00:21:55.396 --> 00:21:58.916
And as Olena Zelensky told me,
"This is our last stand.

00:21:58.956 --> 00:22:00.116
This is it.